{"id":"9a89c52b489c33b7","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-graph-bisimulation.md","title":"开放项图的互模拟","display":"df-graph-bisimulation — 开放项图的互模拟","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-graph-bisimulation","aliases":["56-df-graph-bisimulation"],"display":"df-graph-bisimulation — 开放项图的互模拟","depends_on":["[[56-df-term-graph]]","[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]"],"source_section":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.11","source_printed_pages":"717","source_ocr_blocks":[738],"source_verification":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-graph-bisimulation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-graph-bisimulation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graph-bisimulation — 开放项图的互模拟"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a9c89b3e42d1880\" href=\"?note=4a9c89b3e42d1880\" title=\"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism\">56-df-term-graph-homomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"717"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>738</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\">\\(G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)\">\\(H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)\\)</span> 是同一签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 上的项图，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a>。</li>\n<li>标签部分相等谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a9c89b3e42d1880\" href=\"?note=4a9c89b3e42d1880\" title=\"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism\">56-df-term-graph-homomorphism</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\">\\(B\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphBisim}_\\Sigma(G,H,B)\\iff{}&amp;\nB\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\\land(r_G,r_H)\\in B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(n,m)\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)\n\\land |a_G(n)|=|a_H(m)|\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|a_G(n)|\\}\\cap\\{1,\\ldots,|a_H(m)|\\}\\;\n(a_G(n)_i,a_H(m)_i)\\in B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphBisim}_\\Sigma(G,H,B)\\iff{}&amp;\nB\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\\land(r_G,r_H)\\in B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(n,m)\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)\n\\land |a_G(n)|=|a_H(m)|\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|a_G(n)|\\}\\cap\\{1,\\ldots,|a_H(m)|\\}\\;\n(a_G(n)_i,a_H(m)_i)\\in B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GraphBisimilar}_\\Sigma(G,H)\\iff\n\\exists B\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\\;\n\\operatorname{GraphBisim}_\\Sigma(G,H,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GraphBisimilar}_\\Sigma(G,H)\\iff\n\\exists B\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\\;\n\\operatorname{GraphBisim}_\\Sigma(G,H,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>互模拟是含根对并逐个参数保存结构的关系，容许一对多和多对一。开放节点使用与同态一致的Kleene标签相等；本簇没有把未定义标签当作可匹配任意标签的通配符。</p>\n<p>原书定义没有要求互模拟关系覆盖双方所有节点；当基础图包含不可达部分时，它们不会被根互模拟观察。一个互模拟若恰为全定义函数图就是同态；仅有“函数性”而不保证定义域是整个源节点集时，不额外宣称是同态。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的本地 Terese (2003) DjVu；OCR页块序号为提取文本块标识，不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4a9c89b3e42d1880","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$、$H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)$ 是同一签名 $\\Sigma$ 上的项图，见 [[56-df-term-graph]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4a9c89b3e42d1880","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"标签部分相等谓词 $\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)$ 见 [[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)","display":false},{"tex":"H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphBisim}_\\Sigma(G,H,B)\\iff{}&\nB\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\\land(r_G,r_H)\\in B\\\\\n&\\land\\forall(n,m)\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)\n\\land |a_G(n)|=|a_H(m)|\\\\\n&\\hspace{12mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|a_G(n)|\\}\\cap\\{1,\\ldots,|a_H(m)|\\}\\;\n(a_G(n)_i,a_H(m)_i)\\in B\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GraphBisimilar}_\\Sigma(G,H)\\iff\n\\exists B\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\\;\n\\operatorname{GraphBisim}_\\Sigma(G,H,B).","display":true}],"bytes":1995,"backlinks":[{"id":"ec93c08d698f2539","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-349","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-bisimulation.md]]"},{"id":"faf9dd8d1400edec","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"访问路径、展开、互模拟及同构谓词见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]、[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]、[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]、[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。"}],"outgoing":["904f367f2b11cda0","4a9c89b3e42d1880"]}